  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rehabilitation of Tea Plantations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Tea.Beneficiaries: 2560 (973 women).Description: The group seeks to rehabilitate 792 ha of tea plantations and add another 400 ha. They will manage a tea seedlings nursery to produce and deliver some 7 million seedlings to members. In addition, they will construct a fertilizer store and four collection sheds, acquire a truck, motorcycles and bicycles, and provide services to increase production, reduce losses and improve quality.</narrative>
  </description>
